      "Title": "PhoneNumbers.Extensions.PhoneNumberAttribute",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/PhoneNumbers.Extensions.PhoneNumberAttribute.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Validates that a property, field, or parameter is a valid phone number, using the same\nvalidity check as <xref href=\"PhoneNumbers.PhoneNumberUtil.IsValidNumber(PhoneNumbers.PhoneNumber)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> rather than a loose format\nregex. Accepts a <xref href=\"System.String\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> (parsed via <xref href=\"PhoneNumbers.Extensions.PhoneNumberAttribute.Region\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>) or an already-parsed\n<xref href=\"PhoneNumbers.PhoneNumber\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.</p>\n"
    },
