      "Title": "PhoneNumbers.Extensions.PhoneNumberExtensions",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/PhoneNumbers.Extensions.PhoneNumberExtensions.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">C#-idiomatic extension methods over <xref href=\"PhoneNumbers.PhoneNumber\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> for the formatting\nand validity checks callers reach for most often, so they read as\n<code>number.ToE164()</code> / <code>number.IsValid()</code> instead of\n<code>PhoneNumberUtil.GetInstance().Format(number, PhoneNumberFormat.E164)</code>.</p>\n"
    },
