      "Title": "PhoneNumbers.Extensions.PhoneNumberJsonContext",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/PhoneNumbers.Extensions.PhoneNumberJsonContext.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Source-generated <xref href=\"System.Text.Json.Serialization.JsonSerializerContext\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> for <xref href=\"PhoneNumbers.PhoneNumber\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>,\nso consumers building trimmed or Native AOT apps do not need to hand-write one.</p>\n"
    },
